# Never use the Delete tool

The Delete tool hangs in this environment. Never call it.

To remove files:

- Untracked / local files: Shell with `Remove-Item -Force -- path`
- Tracked git files: Shell with `git rm -- path`

Do not retry Delete after a hang or failure. Use Shell from the first attempt.
